1
00:00:00,287 --> 00:00:03,737
(Howard:)I'm getting worried about Bernadette.
I'm gonna call and check on her.

2
00:00:04,358 --> 00:00:07,708
(Sheldon:)The National Science Foundation
wants to give me a substantial grant.

3
00:00:07,861 --> 00:00:10,141
(Raj:)-That's a big deal.
-I know.

4
00:00:10,297 --> 00:00:12,137
(Sheldon:)When will this nightmare end?

5
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,400
(Leonard:)Hey, I get that you feel bad about
all the attention,

6
00:00:15,569 --> 00:00:18,569
(Leonard:)but still, what you did is amazing.
Were really proud of you.

7
00:00:18,739 --> 00:00:21,739
(Sheldon:)-I'm not.
-You're not?

8
00:00:21,909 --> 00:00:24,449
(Amy:)Sheldon, I've been thinking about it,

9
00:00:24,612 --> 00:00:27,252
(Amy:)and you're right,
you don't deserve any credit.

10
00:00:28,115 --> 00:00:30,725
(Amy:)All you did was misread
some numbers on a table.

11
00:00:30,884 --> 00:00:32,264
(Amy:)A very easy table, too.

12
00:00:32,419 --> 00:00:35,459
(Amy:)Honestly, I'm embarrassed for you.

13
00:00:37,791 --> 00:00:39,931
Thats the most romantic thing
I've ever heard.

14
00:00:41,895 --> 00:00:45,135
(Penny:)Damn it, everyone's
better at this than me.

15
00:00:45,299 --> 00:00:48,749
(Sheldon:)Congratulations, Dr. Fowler.
You just made the fort.

16
00:00:52,439 --> 00:00:54,419
(Howard:)Guys, there was an accident
at Bernie's lab.

17
00:00:54,575 --> 00:00:55,955
(Leonard:)My God, is she okay?

18
00:00:56,110 --> 00:00:58,450
(Howard:)Yeah, but she's at the hospital
in quarantine.

